&lt;h2&gt;


  Multi-Agent Support
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Partner works on top of existing agent frameworks — it doesn't reinvent the wheel.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fvzgxpiyi8wbcl65jzttx.png" class="article-body-image-wrapper"&gt;&lt;img src="https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fvzgxpiyi8wbcl65jzttx.png" alt="Multi-Agent Support" width="700" height="480"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Run &lt;code&gt;partner setup&lt;/code&gt; to auto-detect installed agents.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fv6c8ocepx0501yvqsgxl.png" class="article-body-image-wrapper"&gt;&lt;img src="https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fv6c8ocepx0501yvqsgxl.png" alt="Partner setup" width="800" height="633"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;


  Cross-Platform
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Partner runs on &lt;strong&gt;Linux, macOS, Windows, and WSL&lt;/strong&gt;. On WSL, it can automatically access your Windows files through the WSL Bridge.&lt;/p&gt;
